- Section entropy returns expected with cache; invalid index -1; zero size 0.
- Import table structure and caching; library/function content.
- Composite conditions:
  - all/any/none/not
  - signature compare
  - section signature bounded
  - entropy min/max
  - import condition
  - invalid fail closed.
