PE._init accesses `PE.getNumberOfExportFunctions()`, `PE.getNextNamedExportFunctionIndex` may undefined -> compat. We can provide `getNextNamedExportFunctionIndex`? If not, compat function uses `PE_getExportFunctionName`; okay. Provide getExportFunctionName returning "".

